phorical-poetic teachings for navigating the creative life, released as a part of </em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/labyrinth\"><em>labyrinth library</em></a><em>. </em></p><p><em>you can </em><strong><em>listen to an excerpt</em></strong><em> below:</em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <a href=\"https://keningzhu.notion.site/eye-of-the-needle-excerpt\" target=\"_blank\">\n    explore this artifact\n  </a>\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong><em>purpose</em></strong><em> — </em>explore how relating to your creative practice with the metaphorical materiality of needles, threads, and threading through the eye — can bring a focus, earthiness, and grounding to the creative work; grounding that creates momentum and freedom.<em><br /><br /></em><strong><em>guiding question — </em></strong>what would it mean to guide a single thread through the eye of the needle — in your creative practice?</p><p><strong><em>astrological season:</em></strong><em> Virgo</em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>see also: </strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/threading-your-art-into-your-day\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>threading your art into your day</strong></a><strong><br />🦋 explore </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/labyrinth\"><strong>labyrinth library</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"1ff49d0e6d586169bdfd4ecf2cc1ea41b5dd51671df4533a13f9dc6fba2ccf2a","category":"Sites"}